<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to May 30.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Price   pct change</p>
<p> 1  Oil Search	     3.29     12.39</p>
<p> 2  Village Roadshow     4.70     10.59</p>
<p> 3  Village Road-Pr	3.35	9.48</p>
<p> 4  Seven Network	  5.45	9.44</p>
<p> 5  Boral		    4.19	9.40</p>
<p> 6  Burswood Prop Tr     1.60	8.84</p>
<p> 7  Southcorp Hldgs	4.90	8.41</p>
<p> 8  A Natl Inds	    1.55	8.39</p>
<p> 9  A N Z Bank	     8.99	8.12</p>
<p>10  West Aust News	 5.88	7.30</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Price   pct change</p>
<p> 1  Newcrest Mining	3.27     -5.22</p>
<p> 2  Woodside Petrolm    11.09     -3.19</p>
<p> 3  Plutonic Rsc	   4.81     -2.83</p>
<p> 4  Broken Hill Pty     18.86     -2.39</p>
<p> 5  Davids Limited	 1.24     -2.36</p>
<p> 6  Syd Hrbr Casino	2.14     -1.88</p>
<p> 7  Qct Resources	  1.61     -1.83</p>
<p> 8  Santos		   5.38     -1.28</p>
<p> 9  Centaur Min&amp;Expl     1.57     -1.26</p>
<p>10  Rothmans		 9.00     -1.10</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
